<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Workspace Setup</h1>
<p>A workspace is your team's home in UTMPro. Each workspace has its own links, domains, analytics, and members.</p>

<h2>Creating a Workspace</h2>
<ol><li>After logging in, you'll be taken to the workspace creation page</li><li>Enter a <strong>Workspace Name</strong> (e.g., "My Company")</li><li>The <strong>URL slug</strong> is auto-generated (e.g., <code>my-company</code>)</li><li>Click <strong>Create Workspace</strong></li></ol>

<h2>Free Business Trial</h2>
<p>New workspaces automatically get the <strong>Business plan FREE for 3 months</strong>. This includes:</p>
<ul><li>10,000 links/month</li><li>250,000 events/month</li><li>10 custom domains</li><li>15 team members</li><li>A/B testing, API access, geo targeting, and more</li></ul>
<p>After 3 months, your workspace will switch to the Free plan. You can upgrade anytime.</p>

<h2>Workspace Settings</h2>
<p>Configure your workspace at <strong>Settings → General</strong>:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Name & Logo:</strong> Brand your workspace</li><li><strong>Default Redirect URL:</strong> Where expired/disabled links go</li><li><strong>Custom Domains:</strong> Add your own domain for branded links</li></ul>
